WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.004 --> 00:00:05.130
I think audiences will

00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:06.548
enjoy seeing more 

00:00:06.548 --> 00:00:08.216
of Mary's transformation

00:00:08.216 --> 00:00:09.300
into wolf in this season

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:10.427
and equally,

00:00:10.427 --> 00:00:12.512
more of the wolf breaking free

00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:14.264
and the hijinx that ensue.

00:00:14.556 --> 00:00:15.390
We show the werewolf,

00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:16.224
and we show alot more of

00:00:16.224 --> 00:00:16.975
the werewolf than

00:00:16.975 --> 00:00:18.101
we did in season one. 

00:00:18.226 --> 00:00:18.935
But then there was also

00:00:18.935 --> 00:00:20.645
the interesting reveal of yes, it's

00:00:20.645 --> 00:00:21.896
now a pregnant werewolf 

00:00:21.896 --> 00:00:22.480
as well, too.

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:24.065
[Screams]

00:00:24.065 --> 00:00:25.650
The season opens with

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:27.277
a nightmare sequence.

00:00:27.277 --> 00:00:28.194
As she looks down in her

00:00:28.194 --> 00:00:29.195
wedding dress and her stomach

00:00:29.195 --> 00:00:30.530
just bursts open.

00:00:30.739 --> 00:00:32.240
Umm...again, really old school

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:33.408
practical effects.

00:00:33.408 --> 00:00:35.410
Which is really fun.

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:36.870
And we're literally....

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:38.371
Aaron and Colin are working

00:00:38.371 --> 00:00:39.164
on this here.

00:00:39.164 --> 00:00:41.499
This is the pup,

00:00:41.499 --> 00:00:43.209
that burst out of the tummy

00:00:43.209 --> 00:00:44.169
and attacks Gary

00:00:44.169 --> 00:00:45.045
at the....at the wedding.

00:00:45.587 --> 00:00:46.880
So it's the same suit

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:48.465
that Andrew wore in the first one,

00:00:48.590 --> 00:00:49.674
but it's essentially a big

00:00:49.674 --> 00:00:52.177
prosthetic silicon tummy and boobs.

00:00:52.177 --> 00:00:53.344
And come around here, 

00:00:53.344 --> 00:00:54.763
you can see the guys are like

00:00:54.763 --> 00:00:57.557
inserting the hair one at a time.

00:00:57.557 --> 00:00:59.392
Just blending from the fur fabric

00:00:59.392 --> 00:01:01.770
 into the silicon.

00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:03.354
So we see a hand stretches,

00:01:03.354 --> 00:01:05.231
we see a face muzzle

00:01:05.231 --> 00:01:06.608
stretching out.

00:01:06.608 --> 00:01:08.443
Uh feet stretching.

00:01:08.443 --> 00:01:09.819
Spine busting.

00:01:09.819 --> 00:01:10.695
All the good stuff.

00:01:11.321 --> 00:01:12.572
I got you pregnant

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:13.364
with your permission, of course.

00:01:13.364 --> 00:01:14.574
And not when you were like this.

00:01:14.991 --> 00:01:15.909
Never when you were a wolf.

00:01:16.284 --> 00:01:17.535
Relationships get

00:01:17.535 --> 00:01:18.787
more and more complex

00:01:18.787 --> 00:01:20.580
the longer they last.

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:22.540
And we are definitely no longer

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:23.500
in the honeymoon phase.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:25.794
And as things progress

00:01:25.794 --> 00:01:27.629
they get a little bit harder

00:01:27.629 --> 00:01:29.380
and harder for everybody involved.

00:01:29.380 --> 00:01:30.924
Especially me,

00:01:30.924 --> 00:01:33.384
as you can see in this episode.

00:01:34.803 --> 00:01:36.596
[Screams]

00:01:37.514 --> 00:01:38.139
Oh god! Oh....

00:01:38.139 --> 00:01:38.848
[Roar]

00:01:38.848 --> 00:01:41.351
Mary! Mary! No! No!

00:01:41.392 --> 00:01:42.560
Adding to the romance, 

00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:43.645
adding more wolf,

00:01:43.645 --> 00:01:44.479
adding more action,

00:01:44.479 --> 00:01:45.396
adding more thrills, 

00:01:45.396 --> 00:01:46.898
adding more twists and turns, 

00:01:46.898 --> 00:01:48.108
adding an extra episode,

00:01:48.108 --> 00:01:49.025
and it just seemed to

00:01:49.025 --> 00:01:50.068
tick every box.

00:01:50.068 --> 00:01:51.736
I was very impressed.

00:01:51.736 --> 00:01:54.364
It's never been scarier than it is

00:01:54.364 --> 00:01:56.074
having a child

00:01:56.074 --> 00:01:57.325
that is either going to be

00:01:57.325 --> 00:01:58.451
a baby or a wolf,

00:01:58.451 --> 00:02:00.411
and everything that leads up to it

00:02:00.411 --> 00:02:02.413
is pretty unexpected and

00:02:02.413 --> 00:02:04.499
and pretty chaotic.

